
@Blog.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7125

### Login como Reader
# @name loginReader
POST {{Blog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "email": "joao.silva@email.com",
  "password": "Senha123"
}

### Criar comentário
# @name createComment
POST {{Blog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{loginReader.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "content": "Excelente artigo!",
  "postId": "24063b66-011d-4c11-8291-0cca446ed3ac"
}

###

### Consultar comentários aprovados do Post
GET {{Blog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/comments/post/GUID_DO_POST_PUBLICADO

### Login como Admin
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{Blog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "email": "joao.silva@email.com",
  "password": "SUA_SENHA"
}


### Aprovar comentário
POST {{Blog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/comments/{{createComment.response.body.$.id}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}


### Consultar comentários aprovados
GET {{Blog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/comments/post/GUID_DO_POST_PUBLICADO


### Rejeitar comentário
POST {{Blog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/comments/{{createComment.response.body.$.id}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Atualizar comentário (autor)
PUT {{Blog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/comments/{{createComment.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{readerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "content": "Comentário atualizado!"
}

### Excluir comentário (autor)
DELETE {{Blog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/comments/{{createComment.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{readerToken}}


